=== signal.ts -- the number writer carries 32 bits (`(v >>> i) & 1`) ===
(2**32 >>> 32) & 1 = 0  <- bit 32 of ANY number is 0
setPort(base, 33, 2**32) number branch writes 0 set bits
  so it would stage 0, not 4294967296

